{"id":"vod_sn_37914","vodId":"37914","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"入间同学入魔了","name_cn":"入间同学入魔了","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/db96d3701f3a79a27c8128af2c78c746.jpg"},"summary":"铃木入间（村濑步 配音）被双亲卖给了魔王沙利文（黑田崇矢 配音），没想到沙利文因为没有子孙后代，所以对身为人类的铃木非常的溺爱。随着铃木渐渐长大，沙利文将他送进了恶魔学校巴比尔斯里深造，想要这所充满了恶魔的学校里生存下去，铃木的首要任务就是隐藏好自己的人类身份。　　大大咧咧冒冒失失的瓦拉克（朝井彩加 配音）、外表御姐内心少女的阿萨兹勒（早见沙织 配音）、看上去很聪明其实是个笨蛋的阿斯莫德（木村良平 配音）、拥有强健的体魄和大条的神经的萨伯诺克（佐藤拓也 配音），个性温柔而又善良的铃木很快就在学校里交到了好朋友。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:56:40","playable":true,"episodeCount":23,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RmdTxcgMxP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0U7Hd5uWyJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NFjBvaUmth1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YLQE35jZSh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nTgDmbYN4f1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uK7CQGG6MQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NAwz9AaizX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5sJXgkKHCL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/df8rGcamwQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ySJqZNKyTk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/skJh1axpB91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2L3buGXdfF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/s30kMmzwQm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YyhWJsjygM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6